OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOften cloudy
OL,6,Fwith a few showers continuing this
OL,7,Fevening. More persistent rain arriving
OL,8,Flater in the night, heaviest over the
OL,9,Fhills. Showers following behind.
OL,10,FBreezy and feeling fresher.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FMorning showers move
OL,13,Feastwards through the morning but
OL,14,Freturn in the afternoon. Heavy and
OL,15,Fthundery into the evening with the mix
OL,16,Fof hail. Temperatures around or just
OL,17,Fbelow average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
